            <div xml:id="d1018">

                <pb facs="1070" n="1060" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1060"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.0031/7–849: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul at Tihwa</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Paxton</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-08-10T20:00:00-04:00">August 10, 1949—8
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>112. Re urtel 181, Jul 8. After inquiry Dept unable suggest any Amer at Lanchow
                    suitable for work mentioned. However further consideration this question,
                    including possible appointment outside <pb facs="1071" n="1061" xml:id="pg1061"
                    /> person, would need await clarification mil and communications situation,
                    reportedly deteriorating, in that area.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
